{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The complete original soundtrack to &quot;Battle Suit Aces&quot;, composed and performed by Carlos &quot;insaneintherain&quot; Eiene. Relive Patchworks' quest  find the Pholian Relic Suits through this album's classic anime-inspired musical soundtrack, including sweeping orchestra, intriguing electronics, relaxing jazz, and much more. Includes 43 tracks in high quality MP3 and WAV formats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music and lyrics written by\u00a0Carlos Eiene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing and mastering by Carlos Eiene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Album Art by Eric Huang (Trinket Studios)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performers</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonathan Young (Vocals) - 35 (Suit Up!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casey Lee Williams (Vocals) - 43 (Burning Memory)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PitTan (Violin) - 6, 20</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrew Dunn (Cello) - 1, 20, 36</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RichaadEB (Guitar) - 30</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shea Henry (Erhu) - 33</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kristin Naigus (English Horn, Oboe) - 4, 13</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laura Intravia (Vocals) - 39, 41, 42</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All other live instrumental performances: Carlos Eiene</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054910?t=1759848657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054910?t=1759848657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054910/061390eefe3269b030e8645e08dcd3a21a67d850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=175984